--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Files derived from upstream AutoYara (Apache License 2.0)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The following files originate in the upstream AutoYara project and have been
modified in this repository:

    src/main/java/edu/lps/acs/ml/autoyara/AutoYaraCluster.java
    src/main/java/edu/lps/acs/ml/autoyara/Bytes2Bloom.java
    src/main/java/edu/lps/acs/ml/autoyara/CountingBloom.java
    src/main/java/edu/lps/acs/ml/autoyara/CountingBloomInfo.java
    src/main/java/edu/lps/acs/ml/autoyara/SigCandidate.java
    src/main/java/edu/lps/acs/ml/autoyara/SpectralCoClusteringVBMM.java
    src/main/java/edu/lps/acs/ml/autoyara/YaraRuleContainerConjunctive.java
    src/main/java-templates/edu/lps/acs/ml/autoyara/Version.java

Changes made to these files include refactoring the clustering step behind a
pluggable strategy interface, extending the rule-construction pipeline to emit
a structured result dictionary rather than a single rule, adding candidate
caching, and adding an alternative candidate-selection heuristic.

